  "body": "This aims to clarify the constraint validation for radio button.\n\nThis proposed wording makes it clear that the \"radio button group\" refers to the group of the radio being validated. Moreover, it makes it clear that \"the element\" does not refer to \"an element\" (see #1795).\n",
